# QEMU's Intel 82574L ("e1000e") through Linux's e1000e, in the driver VM,
# which gets every network card. The card attaches to the network service,
# gets an address by DHCP, and nettest pings the gateway and fetches a page
# from a server of the host's through it (no Internet needed).
net ethernet
nic e1000e
nettest local
fail-on "nettest: FAIL"
wait-serial "net: eth0 (e1000e, pci 00:" 120
wait-serial "net: eth0: attached as eth0" 60
wait-serial "nettest: PASS" 300
reject-serial "panicked"
